OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with attempted murder
OL,4,Afollowing stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with attempted
OL,7,Fmurder following a stabbing in Lurgan,
OL,8,FCounty Armagh, on Sunday afternoon.
OL,10,FThe victim was left in a serious
OL,11,Fcondition after being stabbed in the
OL,12,Fback at a property in the Grattan
OL,13,FStreet area.
OL,15,FA 34-year-old man was arrested a short
OL,16,Fdistance away.
OL,18,FHe is expected to appear before Lisburn
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
